        <mxCell id="header-sub" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1e293b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Which steps of a move do users feel, and for how long?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Scope: the 8 steps of the CMP move engine, durations measured after CNP-292 (CMP v0.3.140, moves 9 and 10 on todo-move) · main as of 2026-11-22&lt;br&gt;Out of scope: failures, retry and cancel (a move can only be cancelled before stop_source) · components in move-components&lt;br&gt;v0.1 · source: cnp-docs/architecture/cnp · journals CNP-291 and CNP-292&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
